        "procedure": "Main text: treatment of 2-Y with excess PhNCS at room temperature gave 3-Y in 85% yield. SI: a toluene solution (10 mL) of PhNCS (11.8 μL, 0.10 mmol) was added to a stirring toluene solution (15 mL) of 2-Y (0.166 g, 0.10 mmol). The mixture was stirred overnight at room temperature, the solvent was removed under vacuum, and the colorless powder was washed with cold hexane and dried. Crystals for X-ray analysis were grown from hexane/toluene. The SI body text mislabels the isolated solid as 4-Y, but the section formula, EA (C104H134N7OSY3), 85% yield, and main-text assignment identify 3-Y. EA found: C 69.30, H 7.35, N 5.76 (calcd C 69.51, H 7.52, N 5.46).",
